        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Entergy&#8217;s Registrant Subsidiaries implemented FERC Order 898, effective January 1, 2025. To maintain consistency of the classification of hardware, software, and communication equipment within the Entergy system, and because maintenance costs of such assets are billed to affiliate companies benefiting from Entergy Operations&#8217;s services, similar plant account transfers were made for Entergy Operations.</span>
      </div>
